' 图5-4 统计查询与预警代理时序图
' 用途：展示 query-service 聚合查询和 regulation-service 代理 warning-service 的实现方式
@startuml
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

box "监管概览聚合链路" #EEF7FF
actor "监管人员" as Reg
participant "前端统计页面" as StatsFE
participant "query-service\nSupervisionOverviewController" as QueryCtrl
participant "SupervisionOverviewQueryServiceImpl" as QuerySvc
participant "regulation-service\n企业统计接口" as RegStats
participant "regulation-operation-service\n监管操作统计接口" as OpStats
participant "complaint-service\n投诉统计接口" as CompStats
participant "warning-service\n预警统计接口" as WarnStats

Reg -> StatsFE : 查看监管概览
StatsFE -> QueryCtrl : GET /api/query/supervision/overview
QueryCtrl -> QuerySvc : overview(query, identity)
QuerySvc -> QuerySvc : 计算辖区范围与缓存键
QuerySvc -> RegStats : 查询企业统计
RegStats --> QuerySvc : 企业概览数据
QuerySvc -> OpStats : 查询监管操作统计
OpStats --> QuerySvc : 检查/抽检/整改统计
QuerySvc -> CompStats : 查询投诉统计
CompStats --> QuerySvc : 投诉概览数据
QuerySvc -> WarnStats : 查询预警统计
WarnStats --> QuerySvc : 预警概览数据
QuerySvc --> QueryCtrl : 组合统一概览结果
QueryCtrl --> StatsFE : 返回监管概览
end box

== ==

box "预警代理访问链路" #FFF6E8
participant "前端预警页面" as WarnFE
participant "regulation-service\nWarningProxyController" as ProxyCtrl
participant "WarningProxyServiceImpl" as ProxySvc
participant "warning-service\nWarningRecordController" as WarnCtrl

Reg -> WarnFE : 查看预警列表/详情
WarnFE -> ProxyCtrl : GET /api/regulation/warnings
ProxyCtrl -> ProxySvc : list(identity, query)
ProxySvc -> ProxySvc : 根据监管人员补充辖区/责任人过滤条件
ProxySvc -> WarnCtrl : 转发至 warning-service
WarnCtrl --> ProxySvc : 返回预警数据
ProxySvc --> ProxyCtrl : 返回代理结果
ProxyCtrl --> WarnFE : 返回预警列表/详情
end box
@enduml
